---
---
<section id="work" class="section" aria-labelledby="work-heading">
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10">
    <div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-6 mb-16 md:mb-24">
      <h2 id="work-heading" class="display-lg" data-lines>Selected work</h2>
      <p class="label hidden md:block">Selected products, systems, and client work</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-[clamp(6rem,16vh,11rem)]">

      <!-- AIDA -->
      <article class="case">
        <div class="case__media">
          <div class="frame">
            <div class="frame__bar" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
            <div class="frame__media">
              <img src="assets/img/portfolio/aida.png" alt="AIDA — dental clinic SaaS admin dashboard" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="case__body" data-reveal>
          <p class="label mb-4">SaaS product · In production</p>
          <h3 class="display-md mb-5">AIDA</h3>
          <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-[48ch]">Production full-stack SaaS for dental clinics, requested by a practicing dentist — patients, odontograms, appointments, records, and payments. HIPAA-conscious role-based access to clinical data. Built end-to-end; deployed on Vercel with a self-managed backend.</p>
          <div class="meta-list mb-8">
            <span>React</span><span>Next.js</span><span>TypeScript</span><span>Tailwind CSS</span><span>PostgreSQL</span><span>Vercel</span>
          </div>
          <a href="assets/Omar-Dental-Family-Case-Study.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline" data-cursor="OPEN"><i class='bx bxs-file-pdf text-lg'></i> View case study</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Client-First skill -->
      <article class="case case--flip">
        <div class="case__media">
          <div class="frame">
            <div class="frame__bar" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
            <div class="frame__media">
              <img src="assets/img/portfolio/client-first-repo.png" alt="GitHub repository: First-Client-Webflow, an open-source Client-First skill for AI agents" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="case__body" data-reveal>
          <p class="label mb-4">Open source · AI tooling</p>
          <h3 class="display-md mb-5">Client-First Skill for AI Agents</h3>
          <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-[48ch]">Created an open-source Agent Skill encoding Finsweet Client-First Webflow conventions for Cursor, Claude Code, and other AI tools. Self-contained SKILL.md plus 17 deep-dive references on GitHub.</p>
          <div class="meta-list mb-8">
            <span>Client-First</span><span>Webflow</span><span>AI Agents</span><span>Open Source</span>
          </div>
          <a href="https://github.com/Omazon/First-Client-Webflow" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-arrow">View source <i class='bx bx-right-arrow-alt text-xl'></i></a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Sucuri -->
      <article class="case">
        <div class="case__media">
          <div class="frame">
            <div class="frame__bar" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
            <div class="frame__media">
              <img src="assets/img/portfolio/sucuri.png" alt="Sucuri logo" loading="lazy" style="object-fit: contain; transform: none; background: #00171c;" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="case__body" data-reveal>
          <p class="label mb-4">WordPress components · Nicasource client</p>
          <h3 class="display-md mb-5">Sucuri Blog</h3>
          <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-[48ch]">The client needed new components and more editing control than the native WordPress editor provided. I built configurable components with Advanced Custom Fields (ACF) and an options page, so editors could change text, colors, and component variants. I was also the primary client contact.</p>
          <div class="meta-list mb-8">
            <span>WordPress</span><span>ACF</span><span>Options page</span><span>Editable components</span>
          </div>
          <a href="https://blog.sucuri.net/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-arrow">View site <i class='bx bx-right-arrow-alt text-xl'></i></a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Performance -->
      <article class="case">
        <div class="case__media">
          <div class="frame frame--flat">
            <div class="frame__bar" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
            <div class="frame__media">
              <div class="data-card">
                <div class="data-card__row">
                  <span class="label">GTmetrix grade</span>
                  <span class="data-card__value">F <em>→ A</em></span>
                </div>
                <div class="data-card__row">
                  <span class="label">Optimization time</span>
                  <span class="data-card__value">90 <em>→ 20</em> min</span>
                </div>
                <div class="data-card__row">
                  <span class="label">Landing pages</span>
                  <span class="data-card__value">Dozens</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="case__body" data-reveal>
          <p class="label mb-4">AI-driven performance · Your Digital Resource</p>
          <h3 class="display-md mb-5">From Grade F to A, in 20 minutes</h3>
          <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-[48ch]">Built AI-driven performance optimization that moved client sites from GTmetrix Grade F to A and reduced the optimization process from 90 to 20 minutes. Pioneered AI-assisted Webflow/WordPress workflows across dozens of landing pages, cutting repetitive editing work from days to a couple of hours.</p>
          <div class="meta-list">
            <span>Webflow</span><span>WordPress</span><span>Core Web Vitals</span><span>Cursor</span><span>Claude Code</span><span>n8n</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
